{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not mark detail-less virtual failures as successful.** Virtual/FLAT child contexts report `status == null` even on failure. If the throwable contains an empty `ErrorObject`, this predicate is false and the following branch stamps the span `OK`. Only set `OK` when `info.error() == null`, apply the same guard to both `InvocationOtelPlugin` branches, and add a virtual-child empty-error test for both views.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-KriZ","finding_digest":"51a3f66db19da97dba530ec82c78360805f8e2899dc1162c9f2b8f8b802f1ca4","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgr7m3nrtwux3ostb3ecy6bwba","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::hasoperationerrordetails::statusless-virtual-failure","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::hasoperationerrordetails::statusless-virtual-failure","line":460,"observation_digest":"1ca10c64132a6a8245c8c5b37ceffcdfcc448e9d1cc4daeb05ea4346417c62bd","observation_id":"aro_v1_dsqqyzatfjvieroiywzxz37437","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/ExecutionOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-13T21:27:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_csqr3tgy2h6bfjfq33nutwfx7g","reviewed_base_sha":"45e4ef4720f96e0ebb348c63d43aa3eb785341eb","reviewed_head_sha":"ef905e8912325c465ff4ecc5bbb50f665265ba13","reviewer":"codex","start_line":460,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ekg4vr7zydahg6vdj635cm4czy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T21:27:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
